# Evidence

Put an evidence note in the pull request body. Include:

- Each command run
- Its exit code
- The git SHA those commands ran against
- A gap list of what only a real lab host can prove

A passing offline test proves the fixture on that SHA. It does not prove a live host, a new boot, or that an instance was created or removed.
